 235:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/bignum.c **** /*
 236:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/bignum.c ****  * Resize down as much as possible,
 237:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/bignum.c ****  * while keeping at least the specified number of limbs
