 298:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/bignum.c **** /*
 299:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/bignum.c ****  * Copy the contents of Y into X.
 300:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/bignum.c ****  *
 301:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/bignum.c ****  * This function is not constant-time. Leading zeros in Y may be removed.
 302:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/bignum.c ****  *
 303:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/bignum.c ****  * Ensure that X does not shrink. This is not guaranteed by the public API,
