1025:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/bignum.c ****     /* Exit early to avoid undefined behavior on NULL+0 when X->n == 0
1026:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/bignum.c ****      * and B is 0 (of any size). */
