1078:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/bignum.c **** 
1079:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/bignum.c ****     /* Set the high limbs of X to match A. Don't touch the lower limbs
1080:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/bignum.c ****      * because X might be aliased to B, and we must not overwrite the
1081:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/bignum.c ****      * significant digits of B. */
