2259:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/bignum.c ****                 /*
2260:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/bignum.c ****                  * Next candidates. We want to preserve Y = (X-1) / 2 and
2261:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/bignum.c ****                  * Y = 1 mod 2 and Y = 2 mod 3 (eq X = 3 mod 4 and X = 2 mod 3)
